  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support vulnerable IDPs and host communities in two targeted Governorates Taiz (Jabal Habashi , Maqbanah distircts ) and Hodyiedah city (Al Hali, Al Hawak and Al-Mina  districts) with sustained access to safe water for drinking and domestic use as well improve access to safe sanitation  facilities and reduce incidence of diseases</narrative>
